# Repo shorthand (template — fill in, then rename to repo-shorthand.mdc)

When the user says one of these phrases, resolve it to the paths below. Do not
ask which repos they mean unless the request clearly excludes some of them.
Keep this file short: it loads in every chat.

## "<group name, e.g. frontend repos>"

| Informal / spoken | Workspace path |
|-------------------|----------------|
| <web> | `<repo-folder>` |
| <iOS> | `<repo-folder>` |
| <admin UI> | `<monorepo>/<subfolder>` |

## "<group name, e.g. services repos>"

| Informal / spoken | Workspace path |
|-------------------|----------------|
| <domain A services> | `<monorepo>/<domain-a>` |
| <domain B services> | `<monorepo>/<domain-b>` |

Do **not** include `<folders that are not part of the group>` unless the user
names them explicitly.
